---
const { navigation, projects } = Astro.props;
---

<article class="type-specimen" aria-labelledby="type-specimen-title">
  <header class="type-specimen__masthead">
    <span>PERSONAL SPECIMEN / 03</span>
    <nav aria-label="Site navigation">
      {navigation.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.title}</a>)}
    </nav>
    <a href="/" aria-label="Kai Wern Choong home">KWC</a>
  </header>

  <section class="type-specimen__hero">
    <div class="type-specimen__title">
      <p>SUBJECT / SOFTWARE ENGINEER</p>
      <h1 id="type-specimen-title"><span>Kai</span><span>Wern</span><span>Choong</span></h1>
    </div>
    <aside class="type-specimen__sample" aria-label="Typeface sample">
      <span class="type-specimen__sample-label">DISPLAY / 01</span>
      <span class="type-specimen__sample-glyphs">Aa</span>
      <span class="type-specimen__sample-line">Aa Bb Cc Dd Ee</span>
      <span class="type-specimen__sample-line">0123456789 &amp; ?!</span>
      <p>Making things to understand them. Keeping room for the rest.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <div class="type-specimen__metadata" aria-label="Profile details">
    <div><span>01 / PRESENT</span><p>Senior Software Engineer<br />Ditto</p></div>
    <div><span>02 / PRACTICE</span><p>Good work-life balance<br />is part of the work</p></div>
    <div><span>03 / STUDY</span><p>System programming<br />Recurse Center</p></div>
  </div>

  <section class="type-specimen__statement" aria-label="About Kai">
    <p class="type-specimen__section-label">A SHORT NOTE</p>
    <p class="type-specimen__body">I’m a senior software engineer at <a href="https://www.ditto.live" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ditto</a>. I care about making good software, and I’m learning to leave enough room for everything around it. At Recurse Center, I studied system programming by building small tools from the ground up.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="type-specimen__projects" aria-labelledby="type-specimen-projects">
    <div class="type-specimen__project-heading">
      <p class="type-specimen__section-label">A FEW CUTS / 05</p>
      <h2 id="type-specimen-projects">Selected projects</h2>
    </div>
    <ol>
      {projects.map((project, index) => (
        <li>
          <span>0{index + 1}</span>
          <a href={project.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{project.title}</a>
          <p>{project.description}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <footer class="type-specimen__footer"><span>TYPE / SIZE / RHYTHM</span><a href="/blogs/">More notes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></footer>
</article>

<style>
  .type-specimen { max-width: 1360px; margin-inline: auto; padding: 27px clamp(28px, 7.5vw, 104px) 148px; font-family: var(--body-font); }
  .type-specimen a { color: inherit; text-decoration-color: color-mix(in oklab, currentColor 38%, transparent); text-underline-offset: 0.18em; }
  .type-specimen__masthead { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 48px; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding-bottom: 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.11em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .type-specimen__masthead nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .type-specimen__masthead a { text-decoration: none; }
  .type-specimen__masthead > a:last-child { justify-self: end; color: var(--accent); }
  .type-specimen__hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(210px, 0.45fr); gap: clamp(32px, 7vw, 100px); align-items: end; padding-block: clamp(46px, 7vw, 92px) 36px; }
  .type-specimen__title > p, .type-specimen__sample-label, .type-specimen__section-label, .type-specimen__metadata > div > span, .type-specimen__footer { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .type-specimen__title > p { margin: 0 0 25px; color: var(--muted); }
  .type-specimen__title h1 { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 0.2em; margin: 0; font: 400 clamp(3.25rem, 8vw, 7.2rem)/0.9 var(--display-font); letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .type-specimen__title h1 span:nth-child(2) { color: var(--accent); }
  .type-specimen__sample { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding-bottom: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .type-specimen__sample-label { margin-top: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
  .type-specimen__sample-glyphs { margin: 7px 0 5px; font: 400 clamp(3.6rem, 6vw, 6rem)/0.95 var(--display-font); letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: var(--accent); }
  .type-specimen__sample-line { font: 400 11px/1.7 var(--body-font); letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .type-specimen__sample p { max-width: 210px; margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .type-specimen__metadata { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .type-specimen__metadata > div { min-height: 104px; padding: 15px 18px 16px 0; }
  .type-specimen__metadata > div + div { padding-left: 18px; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .type-specimen__metadata > div > span { color: var(--accent); }
  .type-specimen__metadata p { margin: 11px 0 0; font: 400 16px/1.35 var(--display-font); }
  .type-specimen__statement { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.46fr 1.54fr; gap: 30px; padding-block: 52px 58px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .type-specimen__section-label { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .type-specimen__body { max-width: 740px; margin: 0; font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem)/1.5 var(--display-font); }
  .type-specimen__projects { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.46fr 1.54fr; gap: 30px; padding-top: 40px; }
  .type-specimen__project-heading h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; font: 400 clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem)/1.08 var(--display-font); letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .type-specimen__projects ol { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 25px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .type-specimen__projects li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr; gap: 5px 8px; align-content: start; padding: 12px 0 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .type-specimen__projects li > span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 10px; }
  .type-specimen__projects li > a { font: 400 16px/1.25 var(--display-font); }
  .type-specimen__projects li > p { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .type-specimen__footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 62px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .type-specimen__footer a { text-decoration: none; }
  .type-specimen__footer a span { color: var(--accent); }
  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .type-specimen__hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 35px; }
    .type-specimen__title h1 { font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 12vw, 6.5rem); }
    .type-specimen__sample { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; column-gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
    .type-specimen__sample-label { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .type-specimen__sample-glyphs { grid-row: span 2; }
    .type-specimen__sample p { margin-top: 5px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .type-specimen__masthead { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; row-gap: 12px; }
    .type-specimen__masthead nav { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 2; }
    .type-specimen__masthead > a:last-child { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
    .type-specimen__title h1 { display: block; font-size: clamp(3rem, 14vw, 4.5rem); line-height: 0.98; }
    .type-specimen__title h1 span { display: block; }
    .type-specimen__metadata { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .type-specimen__metadata > div { min-height: auto; padding-block: 12px; }
    .type-specimen__metadata > div + div { padding-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 0; }
    .type-specimen__metadata > div > span { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
    .type-specimen__statement, .type-specimen__projects { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
    .type-specimen__projects ol { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
